WEBVTT

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:05.996
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:08.823
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I enjoy <b>reading</b> in bed.

00:00:10.865 --> 00:00:11.524
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:12.582 --> 00:00:14.437
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Have you finished <b>tidying</b> your room?

00:00:16.501 --> 00:00:17.261
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:18.239 --> 00:00:20.752
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I want to go on <b>working</b> until I’m seventy.

00:00:22.695 --> 00:00:23.468
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:26.951
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I hate <b>being</b> late when I’m meeting someone.

00:00:28.927 --> 00:00:29.740
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:30.706 --> 00:00:32.579
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I like <b>having</b> breakfast in a café.

00:00:34.554 --> 00:00:35.362
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:36.315 --> 00:00:39.177
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I love <b>waking up</b> on a sunny morning.

00:00:41.139 --> 00:00:41.925
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:00:42.842 --> 00:00:46.209
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I don’t mind <b>doing</b> the ironing. It’s quite relaxing.

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:48.836
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:00:49.787 --> 00:00:52.269
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> She spends hours <b>talking</b> on the phone.

00:00:54.424 --> 00:00:55.208
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 9

00:00:56.128 --> 00:00:58.661
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> It started <b>raining</b> at five thirty in the morning.

00:01:00.602 --> 00:01:01.295
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 10

00:01:02.255 --> 00:01:05.442
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Please stop <b>making</b> such a noise. I can’t think.

00:01:07.394 --> 00:01:08.225
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 11

00:01:09.160 --> 00:01:12.855
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I don’t feel like <b>cooking</b> today. Let’s go out for lunch.